From 7c634cb5d3e5f762dd7ad02024adee734e4db0ad Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ayman Chaudhry <ayman.chaudhry.kc@renesas.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 10:30:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] lite: Add missing absl::check and absl::log dependencies

absl::check and absl::log are required when building tensorflow-lite
as a shared object and when missing, result in linkage errors when
compiling applications against tensorflow-lite.

Let's add the missing dependencies to prevent linkage errors.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [depends on shared library build in 0004]
Signed-off-by: Ayman Chaudhry <ayman.chaudhry.kc@renesas.com>
---
 tensorflow/lite/CMakeLists.txt | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/tensorflow/lite/CMakeLists.txt b/tensorflow/lite/CMakeLists.txt
index 3198ec61e0b..266976ad2c5 100644
--- a/tensorflow/lite/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/tensorflow/lite/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -725,8 +725,10 @@ target_include_directories(tensorflow-lite
 target_link_libraries(tensorflow-lite
   PUBLIC
     Eigen3::Eigen
+    absl::check
     absl::flags
     absl::hash
+    absl::log
     absl::status
     absl::strings
     absl::synchronization
-- 
2.34.1

